{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57596","headline":"西王母授紫度炎光神变经颂三篇 三 · 无名氏","name":"西王母授紫度炎光神变经颂三篇 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腾辔控朗晖，宴景洞野外。\n流浪寻灵人，合形庆霄际。\n手披朱岛户，朗若神冲泰。\n金阙欝嵯峨，清景无尘秽，解衿玄阆台，适我良愿会。\n脱屣三涂难，保链固年迈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}